{"2460640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dreaming Diorama", "steam_appid": 2460640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unwind and let your imagination flourish in <strong>Dreaming Diorama</strong> — a cozy, casual puzzle game where you build enchanting miniature worlds, one piece at a time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why You’ll Love It:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle Meets Art</strong> – Each diorama is a delightful challenge, crafted from intricate pieces waiting to be assembled.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Freedom</strong> – Build from any angle, any location. Your strategy is entirely your own.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Peaceful Gameplay</strong> – No timers, no pressure. Just a relaxing experience at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive 3D Exploration</strong> – Dive into beautifully rendered environments and bring your tiny worlds to life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re a puzzle enthusiast or simply enjoy cozy games, <strong>Dreaming Diorama</strong> offers the perfect escape. Ready to create something beautiful? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2460640/extras/ecedd2c165c35fa672f3cda1e4667963.avif?t=1757351088\" width=600 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each diorama is centered around a unique theme — some calm, others lively — offering a variety of moods and atmospheres. As players assemble each scene piece by piece, they contribute to a larger, cohesive experience that unfolds throughout the game. Designed to be both soothing and creatively fulfilling, the game leaves players with a sense of accomplishment upon completion. Whether you love solving puzzles or just enjoy building beautiful things, this game aims to offer a meaningful and enjoyable journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2460640/extras/c31971efee59fe33fcfd79c716acdced.avif?t=1757351088\" width=600 height=256 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unwind and let your imagination flourish in <strong>Dreaming Diorama</strong> — a cozy, casual puzzle game where you build enchanting miniature worlds, one piece at a time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why You’ll Love It:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle Meets Art</strong> – Each diorama is a delightful challenge, crafted from intricate pieces waiting to be assembled.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Freedom</strong> – Build from any angle, any location. Your strategy is entirely your own.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Peaceful Gameplay</strong> – No timers, no pressure. Just a relaxing experience at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive 3D Exploration</strong> – Dive into beautifully rendered environments and bring your tiny worlds to life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re a puzzle enthusiast or simply enjoy cozy games, <strong>Dreaming Diorama</strong> offers the perfect escape. Ready to create something beautiful? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2460640/extras/ecedd2c165c35fa672f3cda1e4667963.avif?t=1757351088\" width=600 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each diorama is centered around a unique theme — some calm, others lively — offering a variety of moods and atmospheres. As players assemble each scene piece by piece, they contribute to a larger, cohesive experience that unfolds throughout the game. Designed to be both soothing and creatively fulfilling, the game leaves players with a sense of accomplishment upon completion. Whether you love solving puzzles or just enjoy building beautiful things, this game aims to offer a meaningful and enjoyable journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2460640/extras/c31971efee59fe33fcfd79c716acdced.avif?t=1757351088\" width=600 height=256 /></span></p>", "short_description": "A casual cozy puzzle game where you create various dioramas. Explore and assemble dioramas in a 3D environment. Enjoy relaxing gameplay that allows you to create dioramas at your own pace with no time restraints.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Czech, Dutch, Greek, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Hungarian, Polish, Bulgarian, Danish, Finnish, Norwegian, Romanian, Swedish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2460640/header.jpg?t=1757351088", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2460640/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757351088", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2460640/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757351088", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB